# Multi-Tool Live Show demo — Only-Lang rules
#
# Two rules, one shared object (resolume_layer_main.strobe_intensity),
# enforced identically no matter which tool's bridge the update arrived
# through. See demos/multi-tool-live-show/README.md for why every tool
# in this demo converges on this exact key.

harmony(1e-12)

# Fires on every update to the object this demo watches, regardless of
# value — gives Phase A (a safe value) a visible, signed ALLOW event to
# show propagating live, not just "nothing happened" silence.
if resolume_layer_main.strobe_intensity >= 0.0 then
    evolve(resolume_layer_main, strobe_intensity)
end

if resolume_layer_main.strobe_intensity > 0.8 then
    deny("Strobe intensity exceeds venue safety limit")
end
